<title>UK: DAIMLER BENZ SETS 2.0 BLN LUX FRANC SIX-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>DAIMLER BENZ SETS 2.0 BLN LUX FRANC SIX-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg SA and</p>
<p>Banque Internationle a Luxembourg SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DAIMLER BENZ, NORTH AMERICA				 </p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DAIMLER BENZ AG  (MOODY'S A1) </p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    31.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.55    PAY DATE    31.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.0 PCT  </p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES	</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    PRAECIPUUM 0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME </p>
<p> NOTES	CREDIT COMMUNAL/GEMEENTEKREDIT IS ALSO JOINT LEAD </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
